Provider plugin logos (fetched at runtime, never bundled)
-----------------------------------------------------------

AC-553: the store tile for the three AI-provider plugins (Claude, Codex, Kimi) shows each
vendor's own real mark rather than a lookalike drawn for this repo. Raymond's call, 2026-08-09 — option A over
the neutral-letterform fallback (option B): direct recognisability in a store grid is worth more than avoiding
a trademark, and the licence risk of showing someone else's mark is explicitly his to accept, not the
builder's. None of the three image files are copied into this repo or the shipped app: each plugin's
`store.json`/the store index's `logoAsset` field names the vendor's own hosting, fetched live
